	- External references are secondary inspiration only.
	- Do not override local governance.
	#### Do Not Repeat Completed Work
	- If research.md already exists and operational truth has not changed, treat prior research as input; do not redo full Discovery.
	- If prerequisites completed Verify, State.md sequencing changed, or PM order changed since prior research, run Research Delta reconciliation instead of full Part 1.
	- Explicitly state what supersedes prior findings.
